# Component Architecture

- Keep folders: `ui` (primitives), `layout`, `sections`, `cards`, `forms`
- Prefer reusable, composable components — avoid page coupling
- Support `className` + `cn()` for composition
- Default to Server Components; `"use client"` only for interactivity
- Extend variant maps on existing components before creating parallels
- Named exports; import from explicit file paths (no barrel files)

See `docs/knowledge/COMPONENT_GUIDELINES.md`.
